{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"spec-verify-lossless","content_sha256":"sha256:e5172b2492c9eca3c5a72ac84d6a2711287fdc7f289a5aef2cf877ce244c3bac","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789924928.878308,"domain":"llm-inference","explanation":"投机采样通过接受-拒绝 + 残差重采样保证与目标模型采样分布一致，是可证明无损的；draft 质量只决定接受率（速度），不改变分布。","id":"q-inference-spec-accept-lossless-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"不会：目标模型用其真实分布对 draft 提出的 token 逐个做接受/拒绝校验（配合修正采样），数学上等价于直接从目标模型采样，属无损加速；draft 只影响速度不影响分布"},{"id":"b","text":"会：draft 模型的偏好会混进最终分布"},{"id":"c","text":"会：温度被强制改为 0"},{"id":"d","text":"不会，因为它根本不采样，只贪心"}],"prompt":"标准投机解码（draft + 目标模型校验）是否会改变最终输出分布？为什么？","review_state":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"judgment","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"Fast Inference via Speculative Decoding","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.17192"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"speculative-decoding","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
